### Listar equipos (con paginación y búsqueda)
GET http://localhost:3000/teams?page=1&limit=6&search=

### Crear: Kansas City Chiefs
POST http://localhost:3000/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kansas City Chiefs",
  "city": "Kansas City",
  "conference": "AFC",
  "image": "https://cdn.freebiesupply.com/images/large/2x/kansas-city-chiefs-logo-transparent.png"
}

